@func new_counter
@template "new_counter(size)"
@help "new_counter creates provider-backed non-negative execution counters."

@func counter_get
@template "counter_get(store, index)"
@help "counter_get reads a provider-backed execution counter as an Aiki number."

@func counter_set
@template "counter_set(store, index, value)"
@help "counter_set assigns a non-negative execution counter."

@func counter_add
@template "counter_add(store, index, delta)"
@help "counter_add increments a provider-backed execution counter without an Aiki get/add/set cycle."
